**/.dockerignore    # Excludes .dockerignore files from the build context.
**/.env             # Excludes environment variable files (may contain secrets).
**/.git             # Excludes the Git history — not needed for building.
**/.gitignore       # Excludes .gitignore files.
**/.vs              # Excludes Visual Studio settings folder.
**/bin              # Excludes compiled output — the container builds from source.
**/obj              # Excludes intermediate build files.
**/docker-compose*  # Excludes docker-compose files — not needed inside the image.
**/Dockerfile*      # Excludes Dockerfile(s) — not needed inside the image.
**/*.user           # Excludes VS user-specific settings files.
**/*.suo            # Excludes VS solution user options files.
**/node_modules     # Excludes Node.js dependencies (if any frontend tooling exists).